$R[327]={name:"丰密",screen_name:"KuiGas"},id:"VXNlcjoxMzcyODc2ODcxOTkwMjcyMDAw",profile_bio:$R[328]={description:"一切都是运气。记录亏Gas的历程，也记录亏钱路上的所思所想所惑。\n分享链上机会与个人判断，坚持以慢制快：成本＋赔率＋风险＋机会＋策略。\n\nhttps://t.co/x7s5UNLArg｜https://t.co/BKnvEl1f2q ｜https://t.co/GPiseM1ZWr｜\n\n建设33DAO @33daoweb3｜亏Club @kuiclub"}}}},counts:$R[329]={favorite_count:149,reply_count:19},details:$R[330]={full_text:"Hack VC @hack_vc 是这2年个人非常喜欢且重点研究的投资基金。\nHACK特点：偏爱领投，喜欢基建，技术背景。\n\n打开他们的投资列表，大部分项目都是大项目，众多耳熟能详的知名项目，比如Morpho、 https://t.co/wpIImU1KYO、Initia 、Eigenlayer、AltLayer、Eclipse、movement等 https://t.co/P4kO6F08XN",smarttags:$R[331]=[]},id:"VHdlZXQ6MTg1MDE3OTI3OTgwMTQ4MzU3NQ==",note_tweet:$R[332]={note_tweet_results:$R[333]={id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0UmVzdWx0czoxODUwMTc5Mjc5NTgzMzg3NjQ4",result:$R[334]={__typename:"NoteTweet",id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE4NTAxNzkyNzk1ODMzODc2NDg=",text:"Hack VC @hack_vc 是这2年个人非常喜欢且重点研究的投资基金。\nHACK特点：偏爱领投，喜欢基建，技术背景。\n\n打开他们的投资列表，大部分项目都是大项目，众多耳熟能详的知名项目，比如Morpho、 https://t.co/Cb8w4qU3O7、Initia 、Eigenlayer、AltLayer、Eclipse、movement等\n投资项目：https://t.co/NJ6wgv1MZF\nHACK的介绍：投资黑客的黑客，加密 VC 中的基建狂魔https://t.co/BwOgYrenie\n\n重点项目👇\n1️⃣Eclipse @EclipseFND：可定制的模块化 rollups ，将以太坊安全性，Solana 高性能与 Celestia DA 三者叙事相结合的首个 SVM Layer2，融资6400万。\nEclipse主网架构将利用以太坊ETH作为结算层，运行 Solana 虚拟机（SVM）作为执行环境，将数据发布到 Celestia 实现可扩展 DA，并通过 RISC Zero 完成 ZK 欺诈证明。\n最近刚上主网，生态很多应用还没来，期待未来的表现。\n\n2️⃣Berachain @berachain：专注于 DeFi 的 EVM 兼容 Layer1，融资1亿美金，测试网数据爆炸，上主网应该就发币的项目。我认为明年1季度会上主网及发币。\n\n3️⃣Babylon @babylonlabs_io：比特币的再质押协议，融资近1亿美金，顶级资本，顶级叙事，原生 Bitcoin 质押、生息，解锁万亿BTC的流动性市场。\nBabylon是一个基于比特币的中间件协议，Babylon协议不但让BTC持有者能够在无需信任任何第三方的情况下质押比特币，即BTC持有者在不将资产转出钱包地址的情况下获得质押生息收益，同时还能将比特币的安全机制引入PoS链中。\n4️⃣Movement @movementlabsxyz ：Move 语言引入 EVM，使得以太坊开发者能够将应用无缝迁移部署到 Movement 网络，同时还可以与基于 Move 语言开发的 Sui 和 Aptos 网络进行资产跨链和数据转移。\n融资3800万，主网上线即推出原生代币MOVE。测试网正在进行中，并积极推动生态基础设施以及DEFI应用。\nMM测试网钱包已经支持okxweb3 @OKXWeb3_CN ，movement挺会搞事，市场热度，叙事，BD等各方面都不错，造城基本成功。\n\n有兴趣的可以把他们投的项目没发币的都找下，\n顺带风险我的个人观点：\n·大项目，不以单点视角，多维度，多角度。\n·不抱怨，细心找机会，仔细研究赔率\n·重点找到自己的交互策略与资金分配\n·做好准备工作，进出自如，攻守兼备。\n\nMOVE起来 #Gmove"}}}}}}}}}))($R["tsr"]);document.currentScript.remove()</script><div hidden id="S:0"><div class="relative h-full overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[600px]" id="urt:conversation:1850179279801483575:none:default"><ul><li><div class="outline-blue-500 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 px-horizontal py-vertical border-b border-gray-100" data-timeline-entry="" tabindex="-1"><article class="flex flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex w-10 shrink-0 justify-center self-stretch"><div class="relative z-10"><a class="focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-[color:inherit] rounded-none active" href="/KuiGas" data-status="active" aria-current="page"><div class="shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-300 rounded-full size-10 transition duration-200 hover:brightness-90"><img alt="@KuiGas" class="size-full object-cover" draggable="false" loading="lazy" sizes="40px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_normal.jpg" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_mini.jpg 24w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_normal.jpg 48w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_bigger.jpg 73w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_x96.jpg 96w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_reasonably_small.jpg 128w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_200x200.jpg 200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_400x400.jpg 400w"/></div></a></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-start min-w-0"><span class="flex max-w-full min-w-0 shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-[color:inherit] max-w-full min-w-0 active" href="/KuiGas" data-status="active" aria-current="page"><div class="max-w-full text-body font-bold text-primary line-clamp-1 break-all min-w-0">丰密</div></a><div class="max-w-full text-body font-normal text-primary flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><span aria-label="Verified account" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center" role="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_1v5c9pimb6b5336_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" data-icon="icon-verified-premium-color" viewBox="0 0 24 24" display="flex" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Verified account" class="size-[1em] shrink-0"><path fill="#1d9bf0" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.75c1.4 0 2.62.87 3.34 2.19 1.44-.43 2.92-.17 3.91.81s1.24 2.47.81 3.91c1.32.72 2.2 1.94 2.2 3.34s-.88 2.62-2.2 3.34c.43 1.44.18 2.92-.81 3.9-.99 1-2.47 1.25-3.91.82-.72 1.32-1.94 2.19-3.34 2.19s-2.62-.87-3.34-2.2c-1.44.44-2.92.18-3.9-.8-1-.99-1.24-2.47-.82-3.91-1.32-.72-2.19-1.95-2.19-3.34 0-1.4.87-2.62 2.2-3.34-.43-1.44-.18-2.92.8-3.9.99-1 2.47-1.25 3.91-.82.72-1.32 1.95-2.19 3.34-2.19M10.45 13.3l-2.23-2.25-1.42 1.4 3.7 3.75 6.24-6.77-1.47-1.36z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></div></span><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-[color:inherit] max-w-full min-w-0 active" href="/KuiGas" data-status="active" aria-current="page"><span class="max-w-full text-body font-normal text-secondary line-clamp-1 [font-feature-settings:&#x27;ss01&#x27;]">@KuiGas</span></a></span></div><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap"><button data-slot="xds-menu-trigger" type="button" tabindex="0" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_qqc9pimb6b5336_" aria-label="More" class="group relative inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-medium select-none transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-70 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:opacity-70 h-8 min-w-8 text-subtext1 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 text-primary hover:bg-btn-ghost-hover aria-expanded:bg-btn-ghost-hover active:bg-btn-ghost-pressed w-8 px-0 [&amp;_svg]:transition-transform [&amp;_svg]:duration-200 group-hover:[&amp;_svg]:scale-110 -my-2 shrink-0" style="border-radius:9999px"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center transition-opacity opacity-0"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="animate-spin size-4 text-[color:inherit]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="opacity-25" cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"></circle><path class="opacity-75" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap" style="opacity:1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" data-icon="icon-more" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" display="flex" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12c0-1.1.9-2 2-2s2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2-2-.9-2-2zm9 2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2zm7 0c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><div dir="auto" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-text text-body font-normal"><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">Hack VC </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/hack_vc">@<!-- -->hack_vc</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> 是这2年个人非常喜欢且重点研究的投资基金。
HACK特点：偏爱领投，喜欢基建，技术背景。

打开他们的投资列表，大部分项目都是大项目，众多耳熟能详的知名项目，比如Morpho、 </span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-inherit hover:underline" href="http://io.net" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">io.net</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">、Initia 、Eigenlayer、AltLayer、Eclipse、movement等
投资项目：</span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-inherit hover:underline" href="https://www.rootdata.com/zh/Investors/detail/Hack%20VC?k=MTg2" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">rootdata.com/zh/Investors/d…</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">
HACK的介绍：投资黑客的黑客，加密 VC 中的基建狂魔</span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-inherit hover:underline" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yLDcbnOsxDJehwrOU5tdtg" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yLDcbnOsxDJe…</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">

重点项目👇
1️⃣Eclipse </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/EclipseFND">@<!-- -->EclipseFND</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">：可定制的模块化 rollups ，将以太坊安全性，Solana 高性能与 Celestia DA 三者叙事相结合的首个 SVM Layer2，融资6400万。
Eclipse主网架构将利用以太坊ETH作为结算层，运行 Solana 虚拟机（SVM）作为执行环境，将数据发布到 Celestia 实现可扩展 DA，并通过 RISC Zero 完成 ZK 欺诈证明。
最近刚上主网，生态很多应用还没来，期待未来的表现。

2️⃣Berachain </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/berachain">@<!-- -->berachain</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">：专注于 DeFi 的 EVM 兼容 Layer1，融资1亿美金，测试网数据爆炸，上主网应该就发币的项目。我认为明年1季度会上主网及发币。

3️⃣Babylon </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/babylonlabs_io">@<!-- -->babylonlabs_io</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">：比特币的再质押协议，融资近1亿美金，顶级资本，顶级叙事，原生 Bitcoin 质押、生息，解锁万亿BTC的流动性市场。
Babylon是一个基于比特币的中间件协议，Babylon协议不但让BTC持有者能够在无需信任任何第三方的情况下质押比特币，即BTC持有者在不将资产转出钱包地址的情况下获得质押生息收益，同时还能将比特币的安全机制引入PoS链中。
4️⃣Movement </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/movementlabsxyz">@<!-- -->movementlabsxyz</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> ：Move 语言引入 EVM，使得以太坊开发者能够将应用无缝迁移部署到 Movement 网络，同时还可以与基于 Move 语言开发的 Sui 和 Aptos 网络进行资产跨链和数据转移。
融资3800万，主网上线即推出原生代币MOVE。测试网正在进行中，并积极推动生态基础设施以及DEFI应用。
MM测试网钱包已经支持okxweb3 @OKXWeb3_CN ，movement挺会搞事，市场热度，叙事，BD等各方面都不错，造城基本成功。

有兴趣的可以把他们投的项目没发币的都找下，
顺带风险我的个人观点：
·大项目，不以单点视角，多维度，多角度。
·不抱怨，细心找机会，仔细研究赔率
·重点找到自己的交互策略与资金分配
·做好准备工作，进出自如，攻守兼备。

